Package: FPLDpdQ
Type: Package
Title: Probability Density Quantile Estimation for the Five-Parameter Lambda Distribution
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Shenal",
    family = "Dedduwakumara",
    email = "shenal.dedduwakumara@adelaide.edu.au",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Provides probability density quantile (pdQ) based
    estimation methods for the five-parameter lambda distribution
    (FPLD). Shape parameters are estimated by minimising the
    Hellinger distance between empirical and theoretical pdQ
    functions. Location and scale parameters are estimated using
    density-based fitting, quartile matching, moment matching,
    or quantile regression with optional weighting.
